        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ntam kanmei Guangh Jisu zauzian pan rui,",
            "Tao aniu neihlana ariu dat the,",
            "khatna suna neihlana kariuna,",
            "Lungning nthanna kata thuanku kho.",
            "",
            "Jisu rui zai kariu loupui zaeng rui,",
            "Kazanh thanmei thuankuna neihla kho;",
            "Meinun khou gaimei guai nai ntanh ngam mak,",
            "Bumaeng Thanmei khouna nai ntang e.",
            "",
            "2. Tingkauh Gwangh hu khou ariu dat khang ning e,",
            "Tingsaeng zaenggaimei tei lakhang ning e;",
            "Pu le tingkao nthanmei nunta houni,",
            "Aniu Gwangh daihmei Jisu zauzian rui.",
            "",
            "3. Kandih khou hei rianra na bam khuan sini,",
            "Tingkauh thu neihlamei ladat puni;",
            "Kathei laimei guai heimu rianra sini,",
            "Tingkauh thang neihlamei ariu puni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
